{'symbol': 'USB', 'date': '2022-05-24 09:00:00', 'title': 'U.S. BANCORP TO SPEAK AT THE DEUTSCHE BANK GLOBAL FINANCIAL SERVICES CONFERENCE', 'text': 'MINNEAPOLIS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--U.S. BANCORP (NYSE: USB) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT VICE CHAIR OF WEALTH MANAGEMENT AND INVESTMENT SERVICES GUNJAN KEDIA WILL PRESENT AT THE DEUTSCHE BANK GLOBAL FINANCIAL SERVICES CONFERENCE IN NEW YORK. THE PRESENTATION WILL BEGIN AT 3:15 P.M. ET ON TUESDAY, MAY 31. A LIVE AUDIO WEBCAST WILL BE AVAILABLE ON THE DAY OF THE CONFERENCE, AT THE “WEBCASTS AND PRESENTATIONS” SECTION OF THE U.S. BANK INVESTOR RELATIONS WEBSITE. A REPLAY OF THE AUDIO WEBCAST WILL BE AVAILABLE'}